Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.05,0:22:14.40,EDCN,,0,0,0,发光,{\blur10\3c&H8E8EE4&}嘿！伙伴
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.40,0:22:16.73,EDCN,,0,0,0,发光,{\blur10\3c&H8E8EE4&}来吧!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.33,0:22:30.37,EDCN,,0,0,0,发光,{\blur10\3c&H8E8EE4&}循着指南针的指引
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.37,0:22:32.00,EDCN,,0,0,0,发光,{\blur10\3c&H8E8EE4&}黄金搭档
